usage: verify_release_channels.py [-h] --output OUTPUT
                                  [--legacy-tag LEGACY_TAG]
                                  [--media-tag MEDIA_TAG] [--timeout TIMEOUT]

Verify published, independent ImageGen/MediaGen channels using public GETs.

All installation exercises run in a disposable directory. Historical v1.5.0
fixture bytes stay unchanged. Media uses the downloaded, tested candidate
runtime with only its temporary VERSION marker set to 2.0.0; this is not a
claim to exercise the original v2.0.0 updater. No generation API is called.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT       Explicit JSON evidence path; written atomically after
                        the attempt.
  --legacy-tag LEGACY_TAG
                        Exact expected stable legacy latest (default: v1.5.1).
  --media-tag MEDIA_TAG
                        Exact expected stable media latest (default: v2.0.1).
  --timeout TIMEOUT     Timeout per public GET in seconds (default: 30).
